USER 3. Access `http://localhost:8080` for the frontend UI or `http://localhost:8080/h2-console` (JDBC URL: `jdbc:h2:mem:addressbookdb`) for direct DB inspection.
USER 4. All validations, endpoints, and CRUD operations are wired per `ARCHITECTURE.md`. No additional dependencies or configuration changes are required.
